# Small local extract from the Mol waterways LDES leaf page, retained so the
# time-series demo is fast and deterministic. Source (retrieved 2026-09-07):
# https://shehabeldeenayman.github.io/Mol_sluis_Dessel_Usecase/LDESTSS/LDESTSS/2020/11/07/readings.trig

